    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0021_faf304320a02.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.29375in;height:1.00694in\" /><br />Coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math><em>,</em> so parabola is&nbsp;opening upward.<br /><math><mn>1</mn></math> lies between the roots <math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi></mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
